
## `.gitignore`

Bunu da ana klasördeki `.gitignore` dosyasına ekle:

```gitignore
# macOS
.DS_Store

# Logs
logs
*.log

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
application-local.properties

# Node / Next.js
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/out
frontend/dist
frontend/build
frontend/.vercel

# Java / Spring
backend/target
backend/build
backend/.gradle
backend/.idea
backend/.classpath
backend/.project
backend/.settings

# IDE
.vscode
.idea

# Coverage / temp
coverage
tmp
temp

# Generated files
*.class
*.jar
*.war

# OS / misc
Thumbs.db